      "title": "Pause the capacity once it is no longer in use",
      "why": "The capacity is currently paused automatically at around 23:38 UTC, but real work finishes earlier. Across 10 running periods with recorded activity, the capacity stayed on for 83.8 h after the last activity. Pausing 1 h after the last activity saves 73.8 h × 5.76 USD/h.",
